# Auth & roles (vcl-forntend)

## Roles (casing đúng)

- `Admin` → `/pages/admin/*`
- `Sale` → `/pages/sales/*`
- `OperationsManager` → `/pages/operations/*`

Nguồn sự thật trên target: `src/utils/routeAccess.js` (`ROLE_GROUPS`).

## Session (target)

- Client: localStorage (`swiftship_session` + `accessToken`) qua `authSession.js`.
- Middleware cookie: `vcl_role`, `vcl_auth`.
- API **401** → login + `?next=`; **403** → home role.

## Legacy (repo này)

- `sessionStorage`: `accessToken`, `isAuth`, `role` — xem `AdminVietNamLogictic/src/utils/Common/authSession.js` và `AppRoutes.jsx`.

Không commit mật khẩu test vào rule/source.
